# Reaches Rebel's package `dns`, so that `heroes test` on this file runs the
# tests of its face, its private modules and the floors under them (spec
# § 12). It prints the mnemonic of the type of a mail exchanger, `MX`, on
# every run, touching no network.

use <rebel>/dns

function main()
    print(dns.type_name(dns.TYPE_MX))
